    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne sceal him nan ealdorman settan dysige deman ne unrihtwise to geongrum: se dysega for his unwisdome ne can þæt riht; 7 se unrihtwisa for his gitsunge forcyrreþ þæt riht, be he geleornode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">No ealdorman should appoint foolish or unjust assistants as judges: the foolish one does not understand law, and the unjust one perverts for avarice the law he has learned.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et nullus dominus, nulla potestas stultos aut improbos indices constituat, quia stultus per ignauiam, improbus per cupiditatem uitat quam didicit ueritatem.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
